<newsitem itemid="187230" id="root" date="1996-11-13" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: ABI Leisure pulls year pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>ABI Leisure pulls year pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31</p>
<p>			    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.2		   vs 9.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.47		   vs 2.93</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.89		   vs up 12.4 pct</p>
<p> Pretax		     5.0		    vs 4.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   92.4		   vs 85.3</p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.3		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Interest		   1.3		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Tax			  1.7		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 31</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 3</p>
<p>NOTE - ABI Leisure Group Plc, which manufactures caravans, said nearly all the growth in turnover was achieved in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
